---
module: nimble
func_id: map-contact
---

***conformance tests***

# map-full-contact
:NimbleContactMapping: maps a `ContactRecord` of :NimbleRestAPI: with `id` `n1`, `record_type` `person`, and `fields` `first name` `Ada`, `last name` `Lovelace`, `email` ` Ada@Example.COM `, `title` `Engineer` and `company` `Analytical Engines`, each as a one-entry value list to a :Contact:.
- `provider_id` is `nimble`, `external_id` is `n1`, `full_name` is `Ada Lovelace`.
- `primary_email` is `ada@example.com`, `job_title` is `Engineer`, `company_name` is `Analytical Engines`.
- `custom_fields` is `{"record_type": "person"}`.

# name-from-email
:NimbleContactMapping: maps a `ContactRecord` of :NimbleRestAPI: whose `fields` hold only `email` ` Bob@Example.com ` to a :Contact:.
- `full_name` is `Bob@Example.com`.
- `primary_email` is `bob@example.com`.

# name-from-company
:NimbleContactMapping: maps a `ContactRecord` of :NimbleRestAPI: whose `fields` hold only `company` `Analytical Engines` to a :Contact:.
- `full_name` is `Analytical Engines`.
- `primary_email` is `null`.

***acceptance tests***
